omatree (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * macOS support (Apple Silicon): no change for Linux packages except
    that OmaTree's own dialog buttons are labelled in English whatever
    the system language, and the Open/New/Save/Find shortcuts now come
    from Qt's standard keys (still Ctrl+O, Ctrl+N, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+F).

